    <li><span>9. Index fund basics</span><span>11</span></li>
    <li><span>10. Why fees matter, with numbers</span><span>12</span></li>
    <li><span>11. Compounding, worked examples</span><span>13</span></li>
    <li><span>12. Opening the account, step by step</span><span>14</span></li>
